Once I have the top choices for each service, I'll calculate the total cost. The user wants a 3-day trip, so I'll assume they need 3 nights at a hotel, 3 days of car rental, and 2 meals each day. I'll add up the costs and see if it fits within their budget. If it's too expensive, I might suggest looking for promotions or discounts on one of the services to reduce the total cost.

